<title>GERMANY: Siemens says 15 pct return goal achievable.</title>
<headline>Siemens says 15 pct return goal achievable.</headline>
<text>
<p>BERLIN, Feb 13 (Reuter) German electronics and engineering conglomerate Siemens AG said on Thursday its goal of a 15 percent return on capital could be achieved by the year 2000.</p>
<p>Siemens chairman Heinrich von Pierer told the company's annual news conference he stands by the goal, even though Siemens' current return is &quot;in the bottom of the middle range&quot;, in international comparison.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
